# What the build context does not need. Every entry is something that would otherwise be sent to the
# daemon and then thrown away.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
storybook-static
**/storybook-static
coverage
**/coverage
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
.lighthouseci

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Tests and their fixtures: the image runs the app, and `e2e` is not installed into it anyway.
e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/__golden__

# `docs/` is **not** here, and that is the point: it is the content of the `/docs` route, read at
# build time by `generateStaticParams`. Excluding it fails the image build with "docs/ was not found
# above the working directory", which is a sentence about a missing directory rather than about a
# missing feature — so it is worth the comment.
#
# Its assets are another matter: 16 MB of demo GIFs that only the README links to.
docs/assets

prompts

.env
.env.*
*.log
